OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fcloudy and breezy especially along the
OL,7,Fcoast at first. Scattered showers are
OL,8,Fexpected through the evening,
OL,9,Fgradually easing in the early hours to
OL,10,Fgive drier conditions by the morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FGenerally dry with sunny
OL,13,Fintervals but also a risk of isolated
OL,14,Fshowers, becoming more settled in the
OL,15,Fafternoon. Feeling warm in the
OL,16,Fsunshine as the winds ease.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
